      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Deep water is patient. Deep water is not merciful.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Ocean Judge (1/Soma Break).</strong> When a creature you can see lies to you, betrays a promise, or breaks a sworn agreement (GM adjudicates), you can mark them for 1 hour. While marked, you always know the direction to them, and your attacks against them deal +tier psychic damage once per turn.</p>",
